CB wage tracker) a z cen ropy Brent směřujících k 100 USD (ActionForex). BoJ zvažuje další zvyšování sazeb (Investinglive RSS Breaking News Feed) v reakci na inflační rizika."],["Protiargument","Americký ISM Services index ukázal zpomalení nových objednávek (ActionForex), což by mohlo naznačovat ochlazování poptávky, ačkoliv zaměstnanost se zlepšila."],["Co sledovat dál","Další inflační data a komentáře centrálních bank ohledně budoucího směřování měnové politiky, stejně jako vývoj cen energií."]],"updatedAt":"2026-11-05T00:46:24.944Z","sources":[{"headline":"ECB wage tracker suggests slightly higher wage growth in first three quarters of 2027 compared with the full year of 2026","url":"https://www.ecb.europa.eu//press/pr/date/2026/html/ecb.pr261104~caf181d7ac.en.html","source":"ECB"},{"headline":"BoJ minutes: board backed further hikes, flagged 50% oil surge as government urged caution","url":"https://investinglive.com/central-banks/boj-minutes-board-backed-further-hikes-flagged-50-oil-surge-as-government-urged-caution/","source":"Investinglive RSS Breaking News Feed"},{"headline":"Brent Is Heading Towards $100","url":"https://www.actionforex.com/contributors/fundamental-analysis/659853-brent-is-heading-towards-100/","source":"ActionForex"},{"headline":"US ISM Services Slips to 54.5 as Orders Slow Sharply, but Employment Improves","url":"https://www.actionforex.com/live-comments/659846-us-ism-services-slips-to-54-5-as-orders-slow-sharply-but-employment-improves/","source":"ActionForex"},{"headline":"AstraZeneca makes $10 billion offer for obesity drugmaker Rhythm, WSJ reports","url":"https://investinglive.com/stocks/astrazeneca-makes-10-billion-offer-for-obesity-drugmaker-rhythm-wsj-reports/","source":"Investinglive RSS Breaking News Feed"}]},"hasAI":true}